🟡 The `method` parameter is ignored when `tiktoken` is available. If `_TIKTOKEN_AVAILABLE` is True, it always uses `tiktoken` regardless of the requested `method`.

```suggestion
    if _TIKTOKEN_AVAILABLE and method == "tiktoken":
        try:
            enc = tiktoken.get_encoding("cl100k_base")
            return len(enc.encode(text))
        except Exception as e:
            logger.warning(f"tiktoken encoding failed, falling back to chars: {e}")
```
